#: /home/runner/work/QualCoder/QualCoder/src/qualcoder/information.py:462
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# Manage\n"
"\n"
"The Manage tab displays workspaces for organising cases, files, attributes, "
"journals, and references.\n"
"Use the [Manage menu](qualcoder://menu/files_and_cases) to choose among "
"them.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Manage Files](qualcoder://menu/files_and_cases/manage_files)\n"
"\n"
"- This menu lets you add and remove empirical data in your project.\n"
"- You can import plain text and many other document types,\n"
"including PDFs, images, audio, and video.\n"
"- You may also import survey data.\n"
"- Before importing text files, you may want to create pseudonyms to protect "
"the privacy of people or organisations.\n"
"- [Help: Import files](qualcoder://help/3.2.-Files/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Manage Cases](qualcoder://menu/files_and_cases/manage_cases)\n"
"\n"
"- You can use cases to group files together that are related to a topic, "
"person, organisation, or any other empirical entity in your study. \n"
"- This can be useful for organising your data and for running reports on "
"specific groups of files.\n"
"- [Help: Cases](qualcoder://help/3.3.-Cases/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Manage Journals](qualcoder://menu/files_and_cases/manage_journals)\n"
"\n"
"- Journals are used to record your thoughts when coding and analysing "
"data. \n"
"- The journal window opens separately from the main window so you can move "
"between them easily.\n"
"- [Help: Journals](qualcoder://help/5.2.-Journals/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Manage Attributes](qualcoder://menu/files_and_cases/manage_attributes)\n"
"\n"
"- Files, cases, and journals can have attributes (variables) that describe "
"their characteristics. \n"
"- They can be used to filter and organise data, and to run reports based on "
"specific criteria. \n"
"- Use this menu to create and manage such attributes. They can be attached "
"to files, cases, and journals directly in the respective workspaces. \n"
"- [Help: Attributes](qualcoder://help/3.4.-Attributes/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Manage References](qualcoder://menu/files_and_cases/manage_references)\n"
"\n"
"- Bibliographic references can be imported from NBIB and RIS files.\n"
"- After that, references can be linked to files in the project.\n"
"- [Help: Import References](qualcoder://help/6.1.-Imports-and-Exports/)\n"
msgstr ""
"# Gerir\n"
"\n"
"L'onglet Gerir aficha los espacis de trabalh per organizar los afars, los "
"fichièrs, los atributs, los jornals e las referéncias.\n"
"Utilizatz lo [menut Gerir](qualcoder://menu/files_and_cases) per causir "
"entre eles.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Gerir los fichièrs](qualcoder://menu/files_and_cases/manage_files)\n"
"\n"
"- Aqueste menú vos permet d'apondre e de suprimir de donadas empiricas dins "
"vòstre projècte.\n"
"- Podètz importar de tèxt simple e fòrça autres tipes de documents,\n"
"coma de PDF, d'imatges, d'àudio e de vidèo.\n"
"- Podètz tanben importar de donadas d'enquèsta.\n"
"- Abans d'importar de fichièrs de tèxt, poiriatz voler crear de pseudonims "
"per protegir la confidencialitat de las personas o de las organizacions.\n"
"- [Ajuda: Importar de fichièrs](qualcoder://help/3.2.-Files/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Gerir los Cas](qualcoder://menu/files_and_cases/manage_cases)\n"
"\n"
"- Podètz utilizar de cas per gropar de fichièrs ligats a un subjècte, una "
"persona, una organizacion, o tota autra entitat empirica dins vòstre "
"estudi. \n"
"- Aquò pòt èsser util per organizar vòstras donadas e per generar de rapòrts "
"sus de grops especifics de fichièrs.\n"
"- [Ajuda: Cas](qualcoder://help/3.3.-Cases/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Gerir los jornals](qualcoder://menu/files_and_cases/manage_journals)\n"
"\n"
"- Los jornals servisson a enregistrar vòstras reflexions quand codificatz e "
"analizatz de donadas. \n"
"- La fenèstra del jornal s'obrís separadament de la fenèstra principala, çò "
"que vos permet de passar aisidament d'una a l'autra.\n"
"- [Ajuda: Jornals](qualcoder://help/5.2.-Journals/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Gerir los atributs](qualcoder://menu/files_and_cases/manage_attributes)\n"
"\n"
"- Los fichièrs, los afars e los jornals pòdon aver d'atributs (variablas) "
"que descrivon lors caracteristicas. \n"
"- Se pòdon utilizar per filtrar e organizar las donadas, e per generar de "
"rapòrts basats sus de critèris especifics. \n"
"- Utilizatz aqueste menú per crear e gerir aquestes atributs. Se pòdon "
"atachar als fichièrs, als afars e als jornals dirèctament dins los espacis "
"de trabalh respectius. \n"
"- [Ajuda: Atributs](qualcoder://help/3.4.-Attributes/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Gerir las Referéncias](qualcoder://menu/files_and_cases/"
"manage_references)\n"
"\n"
"- Las referéncias bibliograficas se pòdon importar a partir de fichièrs NBIB "
"e RIS.\n"
"- Puèi, las referéncias se pòdon ligar a de fichièrs dins lo projècte.\n"
"- [Ajuda: Importar de Referéncias](qualcoder://help/6.1.-Imports-and-"
"Exports/)"

#: /home/runner/work/QualCoder/QualCoder/src/qualcoder/information.py:511
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# Coding\n"
"\n"
"The Coding tab displays workspaces for coding text, PDFs, images, audio, and "
"video.\n"
"Use the [Coding menu](qualcoder://menu/coding) to select an option to "
"begin. \n"
"Note that you can only open a particular coding workspace if that type of "
"data is actually present in the current project. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Code Text](qualcoder://menu/coding/codes)\n"
"\n"
"- Use this workspace to read textual data closely and assign codes to "
"selected passages.\n"
"- You can organise codes in a tree, add memos and annotations, create "
"bookmarks, and mark especially useful segments as important.\n"
"- [Help: Coding text](qualcoder://help/4.1.-Coding-Text/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Code Images](qualcoder://menu/coding/code_image)\n"
"\n"
"- In this workspace, you can select regions in photographs, diagrams, "
"screenshots, or other visual material and assign codes to them.\n"
"- Coded areas are displayed as coloured rectangles linked to your code "
"system.\n"
"- [Help: Coding images](qualcoder://help/4.4.-Coding-Images/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Code Audio and Video](qualcoder://menu/coding/code_audio_video)\n"
"\n"
"- Use this workspace to transcribe and/or code time-based media such as "
"interviews, focus groups, and field recordings.\n"
"- [Help: Coding audio and video](qualcoder://help/4.5.-Coding-Audio-and-"
"Video/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Code PDFs](qualcoder://menu/coding/code_pdf)\n"
"\n"
"- This workspace allows you to code text directly in PDF documents when you "
"want to keep the original page layout in view.\n"
"- This is useful for articles, reports, and other source material where page "
"position and formatting matter.\n"
"- [Help: Coding PDFs](qualcoder://help/4.3.-Coding-Text-on-PDFs/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [AI Assisted Coding](qualcoder://menu/coding/ai_assisted_coding)\n"
"\n"
"- This loads a variant of the text coding workspace that uses AI to explore "
"your data and suggest segments for a selected code.\n"
"- [Help: AI assisted coding](qualcoder://help/4.2.-AI-Assisted-Coding/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Code Organiser](qualcoder://menu/coding/code_organiser)\n"
"\n"
"- Use this workspace to reorganise your code system using a graphical, mind-"
"map style interface.\n"
"- You can move, merge, and rename codes and categories as your analytic "
"structure becomes clearer.\n"
"- [Help: Code Organiser](qualcoder://help/4.6-Code-Organiser/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Colour Scheme](qualcoder://menu/coding/colour_scheme)\n"
"\n"
"- This allows you to change the colour scheme of your codes and "
"categories. \n"
"- Special schemes for colour-blind users are available. \n"
msgstr ""
"# Codatge\n"
"\n"
"L'onglet Codatge aficha d'espacis de trabalh per codar de tèxt, de PDF, "
"d'imatges, d'àudio e de vidèo.\n"
"Utilizatz lo [menut de Codatge](qualcoder://menu/coding) per seleccionar una "
"opcion per començar. \n"
"Notatz que podètz dobrir un espaci de trabalh de codatge particular sonque "
"se aquel tipe de donadas es efectivament present dins lo projècte actual.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Codar de tèxt](qualcoder://menu/coding/codes)\n"
"\n"
"- Utilizatz aqueste espaci de trabalh per legir atentivament de donadas "
"textualas e assignar de còdis a de passatges seleccionats.\n"
"- Podètz organizar los còdis en un arbre, apondre de memòrias e "
"d'anotacions, crear de balisas, e marcar los segments particularament utils "
"coma importants.\n"
"- [Ajuda: Codatge de tèxt](qualcoder://help/4.1.-Coding-Text/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Codar d'imatges](qualcoder://menu/coding/code_image)\n"
"\n"
"- Dins aqueste espaci de trabalh, podètz seleccionar de regions dins de "
"fotografias, de diagramas, de capturas d'ecran o d'autres materials visuals "
"e lor assignar de còdis.\n"
"- Las zònas codadas s'afichan coma de rectangles colorats ligats a vòstre "
"sistèma de còdis.\n"
"- [Ajuda: Codatge d'imatges](qualcoder://help/4.4.-Coding-Images/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Codar l'àudio e la vidèo](qualcoder://menu/coding/code_audio_video)\n"
"\n"
"- Utilizatz aqueste espaci de trabalh per transcriure e/o codar de mèdias "
"temporals coma d'entrevistas, de grops de discussion e d'enregistraments de "
"terren.\n"
"- [Ajuda: Codatge d'àudio e vidèo](qualcoder://help/4.5.-Coding-Audio-and-"
"Video/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Codar de PDF](qualcoder://menu/coding/code_pdf)\n"
"\n"
"- Aqueste espaci de trabalh vos permet de codar de tèxt dirèctament dins de "
"documents PDF quand volètz gardar la mesa en pagina originala a la vista.\n"
"- Aquò es util pels articles, rapòrts e autres documents de font ont la "
"posicion de la pagina e la formatacion son importantas.\n"
"- [Ajuda: Codatge de PDF](qualcoder://help/4.3.-Coding-Text-on-PDFs/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Codatge assistit per IA](qualcoder://menu/coding/ai_assisted_coding)\n"
"\n"
"- Aquò carga una varianta de l'espaci de trabalh de codatge de tèxt "
"qu'utiliza l'IA per explorar vòstras donadas e suggerir de segments per un "
"còde seleccionat.\n"
"- [Ajuda: Codatge assistit per IA](qualcoder://help/4.2.-AI-Assisted-"
"Coding/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Organizaire de Còdis](qualcoder://menu/coding/code_organiser)\n"
"\n"
"- Utilizatz aqueste espaci de trabalh per reorganizar vòstre sistèma de "
"còdis en utilizant una interfàcia grafica d'estil mapa mentala.\n"
"- Podètz desplaçar, fusionar e tornar nomenar de còdis e de categorias a "
"mesura que vòstra estructura analitica ven mai clara.\n"
"- [Ajuda : Organizator de Còdis](qualcoder://help/4.6-Code-Organiser/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Esquema de colors](qualcoder://menu/coding/colour_scheme)\n"
"\n"
"- Aquò vos permet de cambiar l'esquema de colors de vòstres còdis e "
"categorias. \n"
"- D'esquemas especials pels utilizaires daltonians son disponibles."

#: /home/runner/work/QualCoder/QualCoder/src/qualcoder/information.py:568
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# Reports tab\n"
"\n"
"This tab displays tools from both the [Analysis](qualcoder://menu/analysis) "
"and [Reports](qualcoder://menu/reports) menus.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Analysis](qualcoder://menu/analysis)\n"
"\n"
"Use these tools when you want to explore coded segments and relationships in "
"detail.\n"
"\n"
"[Help: Analysis and Reports menu options](qualcoder://help/5.3.-Reports/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"### Retrieval and segment-based analysis\n"
"\n"
"These tools help you inspect the actual coded material in your project.\n"
"\n"
"- [Code retrieval](qualcoder://menu/analysis/coding_reports) is a flexible "
"analysis tool. It gathers all segments for selected codes or categories and "
"lets you narrow the results by file, case, attributes, or search text.\n"
"- [Codes by text segments](qualcoder://menu/analysis/text_segments_by_codes) "
"generates a table with text segments and all associated codes.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"### Code relationships and overlaps\n"
"\n"
"Use these tools to examine how codes relate to one another. They only work "
"with text files.\n"
"\n"
"- [Code relations](qualcoder://menu/analysis/code_relations) shows "
"proximity, overlap, inclusion, and exact matches between selected codes.\n"
"- [Code co-occurrence](qualcoder://menu/analysis/code_co_occurrence) focuses "
"on where two codes overlap or directly touch.\n"
"- [Code text exact matches](qualcoder://menu/analysis/"
"code_text_exact_matches) lists passages where different codes were applied "
"to exactly the same text.\n"
"- [Graph](qualcoder://menu/analysis/view_graph) provides a visual, mind-map "
"style view of linked project elements like codes, cases, files, etc. [Help: "
"Graph](qualcoder://help/5.4.-Graph/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Reports](qualcoder://menu/reports)\n"
"\n"
"Use these tools when you want summaries, comparisons, counts, charts, or "
"exports for reporting purposes.\n"
"\n"
"[Help: Analysis and Reports menu options](qualcoder://help/5.3.-Reports/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"### Inter-Coder Comparisons\n"
"\n"
"- [Coding comparison](qualcoder://menu/reports/coding_comparison) and "
"[Coding comparison by file](qualcoder://menu/reports/"
"coding_comparison_by_file) are especially useful for collaborative work and "
"inter-coder checking.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"### Summaries, frequencies, and charts\n"
"\n"
"These reports summarise patterns across the project rather than showing "
"every coded segment in detail.\n"
"\n"
"- [Code frequencies](qualcoder://menu/reports/code_frequencies) counts how "
"often codes and categories have been used.\n"
"- [Code counts by file/case](qualcoder://menu/reports/code_comparison_table) "
"gives a compact overview of where selected codes appear most often.\n"
"- [File summary](qualcoder://menu/reports/file_summary) and [Code summary]"
"(qualcoder://menu/reports/code_summary) give focused overviews of one file "
"or one code at a time.\n"
"- [Charts](qualcoder://menu/reports/charts) visualises distributions and "
"comparisons with diagrams such as bar charts, treemaps, and heatmaps.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"### Advanced reporting\n"
"\n"
"- [Database queries](qualcoder://menu/reports/sql_statements) gives direct "
"access to the project database for custom analyses. This is most useful when "
"the standard reports do not answer a specific research question in the exact "
"form you need.\n"
msgstr ""
"# Onglet Rapòrts\n"
"\n"
"Aqueste onglèt aficha d'aisinas dels menuts [Analisi](qualcoder://menu/"
"analysis) e [Rapòrts](qualcoder://menu/reports).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Analisi](qualcoder://menu/analysis)\n"
"\n"
"Utilizatz aquestas aisinas quand volètz explorar en detalh los segments "
"codats e las relacions.\n"
"\n"
"[Ajuda: Opcions del menú Analisi e Rapòrts](qualcoder://help/5.3.-Reports/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"### Recèrca e analisi basada suls segments\n"
"\n"
"Aquestas aisinas vos ajudan a inspeccionar lo material codat efectiu de "
"vòstre projècte.\n"
"\n"
"- [Recèrca de còdis](qualcoder://menu/analysis/coding_reports) es un esplech "
"d'analisi flexible. Reculhís totes los segments pels còdis o las categorias "
"seleccionadas e vos permet de restrenher los resultats per fichièr, cas, "
"atributs o tèxte de recèrca.\n"
"- [Còdis per segments de tèxt](qualcoder://menu/analysis/"
"text_segments_by_codes) genera un tablèu amb los segments de tèxt e totes "
"los còdis associats.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"### Relacions e subrepauses de còdis\n"
"\n"
"Utilizatz aquestas aisinas per examinar cossí los còdis se relacionen entre "
"eles. Foncionan solament amb de fichièrs de tèxt.\n"
"\n"
"- [Relacions entre còdis](qualcoder://menu/analysis/code_relations) mòstra "
"la proximitat, l'entrecrosament, l'inclusion e las correspondéncias exactas "
"entre los còdis seleccionats.\n"
"- [Co-ocurréncia dels còdis](qualcoder://menu/analysis/code_co_occurrence) "
"se concentra sus los endreches ont dos còdis s'entrecrosan o se tòcan "
"directament.\n"
"- [Correspondéncias exactas de tèxt de còdis](qualcoder://menu/analysis/"
"code_text_exact_matches) lista los passatges ont de còdis diferents foguèron "
"aplicats exactament al meteis tèxt.\n"
"- [Grafic](qualcoder://menu/analysis/view_graph) provesís una vista visuala "
"en mapa mental dels elements de projècte ligats coma los còdis, los afars, "
"los fichièrs, etc. [Ajuda: Grafic](qualcoder://help/5.4.-Graph/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Rapòrts](qualcoder://menu/reports)\n"
"\n"
"Utilizatz aquestas aisinas quand volètz de resumits, de comparasons, de "
"comptas, de grafics, o d'exportacions per de rapòrts.\n"
"\n"
"[Ajuda: Opcions del menú Analisi e Rapòrts](qualcoder://help/5.3.-Reports/)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"### Comparasons Inter-Codaires\n"
"\n"
"- [Comparason de codatge](qualcoder://menu/reports/coding_comparison) e "
"[Comparason de codatge per fichièr](qualcoder://menu/reports/"
"coding_comparison_by_file) son particularament utilas pel trabalh "
"collaboratiu e la verificacion entre codaires.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"### Resumits, frequéncias e grafics\n"
"\n"
"Aqueles rapòrts resumisson los modèls a l'escala del projècte puslèu que de "
"mostrar cada segment codat en detalh.\n"
"\n"
"- [Frequéncias dels còdes](qualcoder://menu/reports/code_frequencies) compta "
"la frequéncia d'utilizacion dels còdes e de las categorias.\n"
"- [Comptes de còdis per fichièr/cas](qualcoder://menu/reports/"
"code_comparison_table) dona una vista d'ensemble compacta d'ont los còdis "
"seleccionats apareisson lo mai sovent.\n"
"- [Resumit del fichièr](qualcoder://menu/reports/file_summary) e [Resumit "
"del còde](qualcoder://menu/reports/code_summary) fornisson de vistas "
"d'ensemble focalizadas d'un fichièr o d'un còde a l'encòp.\n"
"- [Grafics](qualcoder://menu/reports/charts) visualiza las distribucions e "
"las comparasons amb de diagramas coma de grafics de barras, de mapas d'arbre "
"e de mapas de calor.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"### Rapòrts avançats\n"
"\n"
"- [Consultas de basa de donadas](qualcoder://menu/reports/sql_statements) "
"dona un accès dirècte a la basa de donadas del projècte per d'analisis "
"personalizadas. Aquò es mai util quand los rapòrts estandards respondon pas "
"a una question de recèrca especifica jos la forma exacta que ne cal."

#: /home/runner/work/QualCoder/QualCoder/src/qualcoder/information.py:629
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# AI Agent\n"
"\n"
"Here, you can interact with the [AI Agent](qualcoder://help/5.1.-AI-chat-"
"based-analysis/) to\n"
"explore your empirical text data, get suggestions for coding, obtain "
"feedback on your codes or memos,\n"
"and generate summaries and reports. To begin, use the [\"New\" button]"
"(qualcoder://ai_agent_tab/new) at \n"
"the bottom left and choose one of the options described below.\n"
"\n"
"{{AI_WARNING_BLOCK}}\n"
"\n"
"## [Chat with the AI Agent](qualcoder://ai_agent_tab/new/new_general_chat)\n"
"\n"
"- This is the default starting point for an open-ended analysis or any other "
"task.\n"
"- You can also ask for help using QualCoder.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [AI Topic Exploration](qualcoder://ai_agent_tab/new/"
"new_topic_exploration)\n"
"\n"
"- Search and explore a topic or question across the whole corpus of project "
"data.\n"
"- This option opens a dialog where you define the topic and select which "
"data to include in the analysis.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [AI Text Analysis](qualcoder://ai_agent_tab/new/new_text_analysis)\n"
"\n"
"- Analyse a selected text passage from your empirical material in detail.\n"
"- This will switch to the text coding workspace and let you select a passage "
"for analysis.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [AI Code Analysis](qualcoder://ai_agent_tab/new/new_code_analysis)\n"
"\n"
"- Discuss your codings with the AI Agent, compare different codes, generate "
"subcodes, or create reports.\n"
"- This will also open a dialog to select the code(s) and data you want to "
"include in the analysis.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## Other Options\n"
"- The [AI permissions](qualcoder://ai_agent_tab/permissions) control at the "
"bottom left lets you choose what \n"
"the AI Agent is allowed to do in your project.\n"
"- Open the [AI menu](qualcoder://menu/ai) for more options, for example to "
"edit predefined prompts in the\n"
"[prompt library](qualcoder://menu/ai/ai_prompts), or start [AI assisted "
"coding](qualcoder://menu/ai/ai_search_and_coding).\n"
msgstr ""
"# Agent IA\n"
"\n"
"Aicí, podètz interagir amb l'[Agent IA](qualcoder://help/5.1.-AI-chat-based-"
"analysis/) per explorar vòstras donadas textualas empiricas, obténer de "
"suggestions per lo codatge, recebre de retorns sus vòstres còdis o memòrias, "
"e generar de resumits e de rapòrts. Per començar, utilizatz lo boton "
"[\"Novèl\"](qualcoder://ai_agent_tab/new) en bas a esquèrra e causissètz una "
"de las opcions descrichas çai-jos.\n"
"\n"
"{{AI_WARNING_BLOCK}}\n"
"\n"
"## [Chat amb l'Agent IA](qualcoder://ai_agent_tab/new/new_general_chat)\n"
"\n"
"- Aquò es lo punt de partença per defaut per una analisi de tipe dobèrt o "
"quina que siá autra tasca.\n"
"- Podètz tanben demandar d'ajuda per utilizar QualCoder.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Exploracion de subjècte per IA](qualcoder://ai_agent_tab/new/"
"new_topic_exploration)\n"
"\n"
"- Cercar e explorar un subjècte o una question dins tot lo corpus de donadas "
"del projècte.\n"
"- Aquesta opcion dobrís una bóstia de dialòg ont definissètz lo subjècte e "
"seleccionatz quinas donadas inclure dins l'analisi.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Analisi de tèxt per IA](qualcoder://ai_agent_tab/new/new_text_analysis)\n"
"\n"
"- Analizatz en detalh un passatge de tèxt seleccionat de vòstre material "
"empiric.\n"
"- Aquò passarà a l'espaci de trabalh de codatge de tèxt e vos permetrà de "
"seleccionar un passatge per l'analisi.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## [Analisi de Còde IA](qualcoder://ai_agent_tab/new/new_code_analysis)\n"
"\n"
"- Discutissètz vòstres codatges amb l'Agent IA, comparatz diferents còdes, "
"generatz de soscòdes, o creatz de rapòrts.\n"
"- Aquò dobrirà tanben una fenèstra de dialòg per seleccionar lo(s) còde(s) e "
"las donadas que volètz inclure dins l'analisi.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## Autras opcions\n"
"- Lo contraròtle [Permissions de l'IA](qualcoder://ai_agent_tab/permissions) "
"en bas a esquèrra vos permet de causir çò que l'Agent IA a lo drech de far "
"dins vòstre projècte.\n"
"- Dobrissètz lo [menut de l'IA](qualcoder://menu/ai) per mai d'opcions, per "
"exemple per modificar de prompts predefinits dins lo\n"
"[bibliotèca de prompts](qualcoder://menu/ai/ai_prompts), o començar lo "
"[codatge assistit per IA](qualcoder://menu/ai/ai_search_and_coding)."

